Canada requests Offers to provide services to develop a concept Study for the Ground Segment for the RADARSAT + Next Generation Mission. RADARSAT+ Next Generation aims to achieve the following four high-level program objectives: OBJ1 - Ensure autonomy of satellite system(s) to support decision-making as it relates to national priorities such as climate change monitoring, environmental stewardship and maritime surveillance;
 OBJ2 - Ensure continuous long-term access to SAR data to respond to national priorities;
OBJ3 - Stimulate innovation and competitiveness in the Canadian space industry, through a balanced approach between capacity building and technological innovation;
 OBJ4 - Enable predictable, adaptable and fiscally responsible investment cycles to sustain a long-term approach to access SAR data for Canadians.

